 * 5. The member adds a comment to their own post.
 * 6. Switch back to moderator authentication context (ensures moderator is the acting user).
 * 7. Moderator files a comment report, specifying 'policy_violation' and a justification.
 * 8. Assert that the returned report:
 *    - targets the correct comment
 *    - has status 'pending'
 *    - has the right reason_type and fields
 *    - has no handler or resolution assigned
